# 📊 Sales Superstore Analysis

This is an Excel sales analysis project based on the Superstore dataset.

I worked on the data using Excel and Power Query to clean, organize, and analyze the sales data. I then created Pivot Tables, Pivot Charts, and an interactive dashboard.

## 🔧 What I Worked On

- 🧹 Cleaned and prepared the sales data.
- 🔍 Checked the data for duplicates and missing values.
- 🔄 Transformed and organized the data using Power Query.
- 💰 Created a Profit Margin column.
- 🏷️ Created a Sales Category column.
- 📊 Created Pivot Tables to analyze sales performance.
- 📈 Created Pivot Charts to visualize the results.
- 🎛️ Added slicers to make the analysis interactive.
- 📋 Built a dashboard to summarize the main results.

## 📊 Analysis

The project focuses on:

- 💰 Sales performance
- 💵 Profitability
- 🌎 Regional sales
- 📦 Product categories
- 👥 Customer segments
- 📅 Monthly sales trends
- 🏷️ Sales categories

## 🛠️ Tools

- 📗 Microsoft Excel
- 📊 Pivot Tables
- 📈 Pivot Charts
- 🎛️ Slicers

